<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE3290" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016785260"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016787710"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7FB1A0" style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016785000" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE2820"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163EBBA0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE2100" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016781050" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE9250"><tr width="680" height="30px" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016785F50"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016780930" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 30px; width: 680px;"></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016787970" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE8C60"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE8080"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE7E20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/qantas-header-banner.jpg" title="Qantas" style="width: 680px;"></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016783030" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C806070"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167820F0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163E9250" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016782580"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167834F0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8023D0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C805120" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE6660"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016783750" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000163F1FC0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C806530" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001678EA70"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001677FD80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">I hope this email finds you well. It's been just over <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[XXX]</span> months since your Corporate Airfares Agreement started and I trust <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[XXXX organisation]</span> is seeing some great value in the partnership.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE1080"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE0280">I'm writing today to introduce you to your Qantas Account Manager, <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[AM Name]</span>, who I'm pleased to advise will be managing the partnership between <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[XXXX organisation]</span> and Qantas moving forward. <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[AM Name]</span> will reach out to you again within the next few weeks to schedule your first Account Review. Of course, if you have any queries in the meantime please don't hesitate to get in touch.</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C804C60"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BDDCE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BDF200"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE1650" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Key agreement terms:<ul data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C808C70" style="margin: 5px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C805950" style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 15px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); margin: 5px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C801920" style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Annual forecast Qantas spend: <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[$$$$]</span></span></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016789720" style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 15px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); margin: 5px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BDEE70" style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Forecast market share targets: 90% domestic | 70% international</span></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C802890" style="font-weight: bold; line-height: 15px; color: rgb(228, 0, 0); margin: 5px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BDF8E0" style="font-weight: normal; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;">Data Release Authorisation: returned</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7FF3E0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001678C180" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BDE070"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C809390" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">We also included <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[XXX Frequent Flyer status upgrades]</span> for <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[XXXX organisation]</span> upon commencement of our agreement. These have all been processed, except for <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[XXXX upgrades]</span> which remain unallocated.</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8081C0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C801330" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8016C0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C804540" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">It's been great working with you during this implementation phase and I wish you all the best.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE0170"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BDF6A0">Kind regards,</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001678D310"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE6D80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7FF8A0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7FFD40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BDF590">{!User.Title}<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BDEC30"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BDEB20">Qantas Corporate Sales<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BDDAA0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE6B20">Qantas Airways Limited</em><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BDD990"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C808A30">A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8087B0">P. 13 10 85<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C807F80">E. {!User.Email}</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7FAAC0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C801590" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167888E0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001678D570" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/footer/QF-oneworld-logo.png" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" width="300px" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001678E700" style="display: block;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7FFE70"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C802D50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001678AAF0"><td border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016784B50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px;"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7FBD80">Qantas Privacy Notice</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C807640">Qantas collects information about you (including health information where necessary) to provide products and services to you, process your travel arrangements, facilitate your participation in the loyalty programs of Qantas and other organisations, conduct marketing activities and market research. If the information is not provided Qantas may not be able to provide the service requested. Qantas may disclose your personal information to its related companies, other carriers, travel service providers, organisations which provide services to Qantas, third parties acting on Qantas' behalf, various law enforcement agencies and governments around the world for security, customs and immigration purposes. Further details can be found in our Privacy Statement on qantas.com. You can gain access to the information Qantas holds about you by contacting Qantas Corporate Sales on 13&nbsp;10&nbsp;85.</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C807BF0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001678B470" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001678B210"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016788B40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C8007F0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C800330" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE8EC0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE6400"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE7240"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE3AE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7FEA60" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016786D90"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001C7FDFB0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BE1D70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 30px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>